{
  "color": {
    "mode": "palette-classic"
  },
  "description": "Мониторинг цепочки DM → Planner → Expert-GC. Все метрики собираются экспортером :9310.",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": 6,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Скорость входящих запросов на каждую стадию цепочки. inbound — сообщения WebSocket от пользователя; остальные линии появятся, когда Router начнёт публиковать свои ib_req_total{stage=…}.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "textSize": {
          "title": 16,
          "value": 14
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(ib_req_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests per Stage",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Время прохождения запроса по стадиям. P50 — медиана, P95 — хвост. Зелёная/жёлтая линия = classify (Decision-Router); синяя/розовая = thinking (Planner + Expert-GC).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, rate(ib_stage_latency_sec_bucket[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "P50 {{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(ib_stage_latency_sec_bucket[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 {{stage}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Stage Latency P50/95",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Частота таймаутов Expert Group Chat за последние 5 минут (ib_timeout_total{kind=\"gc\"} / сек). >0.05 rps ≈ >3 timeouts/мин — признак перегрузки или слишком малого GC_TIMEOUT_SEC.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "textSize": {
          "title": 14,
          "value": 22
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(ib_timeout_total{kind=\"gc\"}[5m]) or on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Expert-GC Timeouts",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Доля запросов, где Browser-tool не ответил за WEB_SEARCH_TIMEOUT_SEC и вернул \"TIMEOUT\" (kind=\"websearch\").",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "textSize": {
          "title": 14,
          "value": 22
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(ib_timeout_total{kind=\"websearch\"}[5m]) or on() vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Web-Search Timeouts",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Распределение оценок полноты, выставленных Critic-агентом (0 — плохой, 1 — идеальный ответ). Ячейки отражают ib_critic_score_bucket. Ленты < 0.5 — сигнал, что RAG или Search дают нерелевантные факты.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "vis": false
            },
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            }
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "cellValues": {},
        "color": {
          "exponent": 0.5,
          "fill": "dark-orange",
          "mode": "spectrum",
          "reverse": false,
          "scale": "exponential",
          "scheme": "OrRd",
          "steps": 64
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 1E-9
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": false
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "show": true,
          "yHistogram": false
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "unit": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(ib_critic_score_bucket[5m])",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Critic-Score Heatmap",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Количество записей в таблице dialog_log, где хранится полный диалог ≤ DIALOG_TTL_DAYS (по-умолчанию 90 дней). Инкрементируется при каждом новом сообщении пользователя.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "textSize": {
          "title": 14,
          "value": 22
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sqlite_table_rows{table=\"dialog_log\"}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "SQLite Rows",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Реальное число векторов в коллекциях: docs — RAG-документы, dialogs — свежие диалоги (после nightly archive + re-index). Метрика обновляется скриптом update_qdrant_counts() после ingest и TTL-архивации.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "textSize": {
          "title": 14,
          "value": 22
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "qdrant_collection_points{collection=~\".+\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{collection}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Qdrant Points",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Скорость сообщений прогресса (thinking, searching, step N/M) в Redis-канале status_bus. Высокие пики без роста Requests per Stage — признак циклов в GC или повторных поисков.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "rps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(ib_status_bus_throughput_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{stage}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Status-Bus Throughput",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": [
    "ib-assistant",
    "prod"
  ],
  "theme": "light",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
